  "title": "Extcap/ssh-base: Use password authentication before keys",
  "description": "expcap/ssh-base.c uses common sequence to login to a device - keys and\nthen password authentication.\nOn many cisco devices, when ssh keys are tried, ssh connection fails\nfor no clear reason and libssh do not detect it. Therefore provided\npassword will fail.\nI changed sequence to use password before keys.\n\nThe idea for change is simple. If user provided password, they are\nsure it is necessary for successful login to the device.",
